### Phase 4 — API Mocking Strategy

**STATUS: ✅ COMPLETED**

Centralized route interceptors implemented in `tests/e2e/mocks/api-handlers.ts`:

```ts
// Pattern: Each handler returns a factory for success/failure/error scenarios
export const mockHandlers = {
  auth: {
    loginSuccess: (role: UserRole) => ({ status: 200, body: { token: '...', user: mockUsers[role] } }),
    loginFailure: () => ({ status: 401, body: { error: 'Invalid credentials' } }),
  },
  tna: {
    listSuccess: () => ({ status: 200, body: { data: mockTNAs } }),
    approveSuccess: (id: string) => ({ status: 200, body: { request_id: id, status: 'APPROVED' } }),
    approveFail500: () => ({ status: 500, body: { error: 'Internal server error' } }),
    notFound404: () => ({ status: 404, body: { error: 'Request not found' } }),
  },
  payment: {
    chargeSuccess: () => ({ status: 200, body: { transaction_id: '...', status: 'COMPLETED' } }),
    chargeFailed: () => ({ status: 402, body: { error: 'Payment declined' } }),
  },
  binding: {
    terminateBlocked: () => ({ status: 409, body: { error: 'Cannot unlink: Active deliveries in progress' } }),
    terminateSuccess: () => ({ status: 200, body: { status: 'TERMINATED' } }),
  },
};
```

**Scenarios covered per endpoint:**

| Endpoint Pattern | 200 | 401 | 404 | 409 | 500 |
|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| `POST /auth/login` | ✅ | ✅ | — | — | ✅ |
| `GET /tna/requests` | ✅ | — | ✅ | — | ✅ |
| `POST /tna/approve` | ✅ | — | ✅ | — | ✅ |
| `POST /payment/charge` | ✅ | — | — | — | ✅ |
| `DELETE /binding/:id` | ✅ | — | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| `POST /carrier/shipment/status` | ✅ | — | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |

