## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
1. `npx playwright install` — Install browser binaries
2. `npm run dev` (background) — Start Next.js dev server
3. `npx playwright test` — Run full suite
4. `npx playwright test --grep @critical` — Run critical-path-only subset
5. `npx playwright show-report` — View HTML report with screenshots/traces

### Manual Verification
- Visually confirm the implemented TNA detail page (`/gov/tna-queue/req-pending-1`) matches the address-queue detail page's layout
- Verify RTL layout in Arabic locale for all 4 role dashboards
- Confirm trace files attach to every failed assertion for debugging

